          }
        },
        "faq_item_N7jwDn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "name": "fuel TAB",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What kind of fuel does a Tsubota Pearl lighter use?",
            "answer": "<p>Tsubota Pearl lighters use Zippo Style Liquid Fuel, which can be purchased <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/collections/lighter-supplies/products/zippo-lighter-fluid\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"zippo lighter fluid\">here, </a>or at any local hardware store. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_iTGG9m": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "name": "refill lighter TAB",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do you refill a Tsubota Pearl or Zippo-style lighter?",
            "answer": "<p>We’ve got full refill instructions right here, friend: <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/pages/lighter-maintenance\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tsubota Pearl repair guide for: bolbo, queue, and hard-edge\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Lighter Maintenance Guides</strong></span></a></p><p></p><h5><em>How often should I refill my lighter?</em></h5><p>It depends on how often you light up, but most folks refill every 1–3 weeks with regular use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_QmMGWt": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "name": "flint & wicks TAB",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where can I purchase flint or wicks?",
            "answer": "<p>We sell flint in <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/collections/flint-wick/products/flint-replacement-pack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Lighter flint for Tsubota Pearl or Zippo lighters\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>20 packs</strong></span></a>, as well as wicks for Tsubota Pearl <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/collections/flint-wick/products/queue-bolbo-wick\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"10x replacement wick for Tsubota Pearl 'Queue' and 'Bolbo' lighters\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Bolbo, Queue</strong></span></a>, and <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/collections/flint-wick/products/hard-edge-flip-top-replacement-wick\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"replacement wick for Tsubota Pearl Hard-Edge lighters\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Hard-Edge</strong></span></a> (flip top) lighters. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_qWnVWm": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "name": "return lighter TAB",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return a used lighter?",
            "answer": "<p>Unfortunately, no. Due to safety regulations, used lighters (struck with flint or fueled) can’t be returned. See our <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/pages/returns-and-refunds-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Lighter Return Policy\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Lighter Return Policy</strong></span></a> for details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_QNa4H4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "name": "lighter no worky TAB",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My lighter won't light! What's wrong?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with the basics: check your fuel level, flint, wick length, and whether the wheel turns smoothly. Still stuck? Head to the <a href=\"https://www.lightprovisions.com/pages/lighter-maintenance\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tsubota Pearl lighter maintenance and troubleshooting.\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Troubleshooting Section.</strong></span></a></p>"
          }
        },
